oag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"x063XOQJCfTsKvS7iPLSsQ","review_id":"pg9UuyzZiIO6AbN105mmuw","date":"2020-03-07T22:41:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9297110438346863,"text_excerpt":"I came here on a Saturday afternoon with two friends. We put our name on the waitlist beforehand and waited approximately 45 minutes for our table. Luckily, there were some benches outside to sit on while we waited! When we entered, we were greeted by a very friendly waitress who thoroughly went over all the different menu options. One of my friends has a gluten allergy but was able to find plenty of options that catered to her dietary needs. They have a separate gluten friendly menu which was impressive! I decided to order the carnitas benedict which was one of the seasonal selections on the menu. It was so tasty!!! I especially loved the pepper jack cheese and green onion cornbread that..."},{"business_id":"x063XOQJCfTsKvS7iPLSsQ","review_id":"A8GNqQS_t0qYYbtbvBpcHA","date":"2017-01-23T23:01:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9257060289382935,"text_excerpt":"Visited this past Saturday morning, surprisingly no wait time which is rare if you've every visited Another Broken Egg cafe on a weekend morning. Tony was our server who was amazing. Very attentive and genuinely nice guy. Our food was okay, nothing special unfortunately but the beignets are AMAZING. The honey marmalade is to die for; it's definitely what keeps us coming back lol. The pancakes were huge but kinda dense. The orange juice is fresh squeezed which is always a good thing. A pretty good visit overall."},{"business_id":"x063XOQJCfTsKvS7iPLSsQ","review_id":"5yK-EozEcgJvukrU_aFDhQ","date":"2020-10-04T13:17:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9245235919952393,"text_excerpt":"I forgot how great this place is or maybe they've stepped up their game. After a morning doctors appointment, we stopped in for breakfast. 10am on a Sunday and they sat us right away. Score! Metered parking (there's an app for convenience)on Magazine street or hard to find residential non metered parking on the side streets. Our hostess seated us inside(still too humid for me outside(September) but would definitely dine out at their many tables in the courtyard. It was chilly inside, but that's more on the Pirate than me. I also keep a sweater & hoodie in the car for just such an occasion- Update -brought the kids here and the staff takes the Covid seriously. Everyone is masked up, saniti..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"x063XOQJCfTsKvS7iPLSsQ","photo_id":"uPmv62SeXAmN1wals7hSRA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uPmv62SeXAmN1wals7hSRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8690288066864014},{"business_id":"x063XOQJCfTsKvS7iPLSsQ","photo_id":"NAkSV1ytk-0fUT69_2pPHQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/NAkSV1ytk-0fUT69_2pPHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8409965634346008},{"business_id":"x063XOQJCfTsKvS7iPLSsQ","photo_id":"DLKrH9vSAoetcBITmctEEg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DLKrH9vSAoetcBITmctEEg.jpg","v